      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-30T08:30:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since it use BTM_BLE_SEC_ENCRYPT_MITM level, so the security level of the link can be checked.\nTherefore, unless the IO capabilities of the remote device is NoInputNoOutput, it will not be automatically repaired and will have to be confirmed by the user.\n\nI have a question.\nCan you share where the specification you mentioned is?",
