      "writtenOn": "2023-10-30T16:45:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See \"5.2.2.3 Secure Simple Pairing after authentication failure, Generic Access Profile, BLUETOOTH CORE SPECIFICATION Version 5.4 | Vol 3, Part C\" for BR/EDR.\n\n\"2.4.4.2 Encryption setup using LTK, Security Manager Specification, BLUETOOTH CORE SPECIFICATION Version 5.4 | Vol 3, Part H\" for LE.",
      "parentUuid": "77ceeb14_19d1ae85",
