      "side": 1,
      "message": "The description of change does not match the change. That is, even with the proposed changes the remote device is not disconnected immediately.\n\nA better solution would have been to not inform the applications of the reconnection until the agreed security level is not reinstated.",
      "parentUuid": "2cc7d24a_b2b96877",
      "revId": "fb47c372d574467e723ffe8dde1565c754300934",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
