      "writtenOn": "2023-10-30T08:30:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At the first key missing, the central already removes the BTM_SEC_LE_LINK_KEY_KNOWN flag. Therefore, instead of simply encrypting, it will induce repairing,\nBecause of it, the encryption will not fail again due to the same cause(key missing).",
